  "code" : "public int[] findMissingRepeatingNumber(int[] a) {\n    long n = a.length;\n    long SN = (n * (n + 1)) / 2;\n    long S2N = (n * (n + 1) * (2 * n + 1)) / 6;\n    long S = 0, S2 = 0;\n\n    for (int val : a) {\n        S += val;\n        S2 += (long) val * val;\n    }\n\n    long val1 = S - SN;         // X - Y\n    long val2 = (S2 - S2N) / val1; // X + Y\n    long x = (val1 + val2) / 2; // repeating\n    long y = x - val1;          // missing\n\n    return new int[]{(int) x, (int) y};\n}",
